{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山の温かいコメントありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初コメさんも沢山まあやのブログに来てくれてて、嬉しい〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度もコメントくれてる方も♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アドバイスくれてる方も♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１人１人大切に読みました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃパワー充電出来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場に来てくれてる方も、行けないけど応援してくれてる方も、まあやには大切な人です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう〜!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年のプリンシパルでは毎日一分間の自己PRをするのが凄く大変でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今年はそれがなく、でも、最初に演技をやって、次にアドリブに答える...\nという内容に一幕はなっていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アドリブなので、何を言われるかわからなくて、色々勘違いしたことをここに書きたいと思います...(T^T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと見に来てくださった方が『？？？』と思った方がいるとおもうので、ここでその時の事を書きたいと思います"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1．\nまず、急に『トリオ漫才』をしてくださいと言われ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやがツッコミで(゜o゜)＼(-_-)\nななせまるとあしゅりんが、ボケなんですけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私だけついていけなく......\n原因はトリオ漫才だからトリについてのネタを言うのかと思い、漫才がなりたたなかったり...(泣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2．\n弁当をテーマに漫才と言われたときは..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日の丸弁当と日の丸タクシー（地元で走ってるタクシーの名前）をかけて、\nタクシーの運転手が食べてる弁当は何でしょう？って言っても伝わりませんでした...(T-T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ広島出身のひめたんに言ったら伝わったのでもしかしたら日の丸タクシーはローカルだったのかなぁ......？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん。後は..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3．\n等身大でいってくださいと言われたので、背伸びしてやったら、ありのまま？って意味だったらしく......(T^T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後は..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4．"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日傘を上手くさばいてください。\nと言われたので...\n包丁で切るふりしたら、さばくはまた違う意味だったらしい......(/_;)/~~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本語って難しいです...(T^T)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも日傘のさばくに関してはろってぃーもまあやと同じ考えだったんだって！良かった〜\n(^-^)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山間違えたので、『？？？』\nっと思った方々、これで謎が解けて下されば嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後少し、舞台がんばります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バナナマンの設楽さんとmember"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、英単語のテストで間違いが1つだけだったよ〜♪ヽ(´▽｀)/\nrとl間違えてただけだったのー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の事で一杯になっちゃうけど、\nプリンシパル参加できなかったメンバーの気持ちの分も一緒に頑張りたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやの体調を気にしてくれて、ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやも...\n皆が元気でいてくれますように(^ー^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/05/11/9868557/0014.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}